  "checklist": [
    "Width: both panels together are 1246 px (vanilla 913); the template panel ends above the army portraits",
    "A line: rename it in its box, pick a name from the list, the deploy and cancel buttons",
    "A card: set a location (the button, then the map), assign an order, the series - and +, the three priority dots, fold and unfold, the two order arrows",
    "A template: Train (and Shift+click for five), Edit, the decommission toggle, delete on a template of your own",
    "The symbol picker: pick a symbol, Default symbol, Back",
    "Shift+F opens the division designer",
    "Priority rows (step 2): six rows as wide as the cards under them, each in its own colour, label and meter whole, the three dots"
